      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Lining up the kitchen and dining room staff, Nagiyev snaps at Senya to wipe the smile off his face and scolds Nastya in the middle of the crossfire. He warns everyone that an important guest is coming to the restaurant and threatens dire consequences if anyone dares to screw up.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Значит так.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Чё ты улыбаешься, вялый, а?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
